---
code: cli-file-not-found
when-fires: an input file does not exist. cli/lib.rs humane_read_error, NotFound arm. {kind} names what we were reading, {path} is the users own spelling.
why: AID-NEEDS:law-codes-vary-by-world-not-grammar: one of THREE sibling codes over io::ErrorKind - a missing file, an unreadable one, and an unclassed OS failure are different world-states with different repairs. Never the platforms raw phrasing.
edit-loop: edit a sentence in the transcript below, then run `mise run loom:compile -- cli-file-not-found && mise run loom:promote -- cli-file-not-found`. `mise run loom:vars -- --all cli-file-not-found` lists this case's values; type {{name}} to insert or move one.
---
-- replay --
$ dorc plan --book=webhost.sh
error[cli-file-not-found]: sm cannot read book `webhost.sh`: no such file
